      "title": "DoIP/UDS: Last UDS message does not overwrite previous",
      "message": "DoIP/UDS: Last UDS message does not overwrite previous\n\nThis patch allows to show all DoIP and UDS messages in a packet instead\nof only showing the last UDS message.\n\nA new config option in UDS allows to go back to the old behavior.\n",
      "author_name": "Dr. Lars Völker",
      "author_email": "lars.voelker@technica-engineering.de",
      "authored_date": "2024-08-21T21:03:31.000+02:00",
